		{
			x: -3.5d
			y: -2.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "EXPLANATION OF PURCHASE BENEFITS"
			description: [
				"&2Welcome Power User. You've been granted access to the DLC shop!"
				""
				"&2We at the FOP believe that to obtain the &n&lhighest sense of Pride and Accomplishment&r&2, as well as protect users new to the Game Server, that everything beyond basic components and systems are not available to new users. Instead, &n&lusers must earn access&r&2!"
				""
				"&2There are two types of DLC: &n&lResearch DLC&r&2, which is located in your &n&lVault Hunters GUI&r&2 (Default key: H), which costs &n&lKnowledge&r&2, and &n&lShop DLC&r&2, which costs Vault Coins and can be found here!"
				""
				"&2At first, you'll have only a few items available to purchase. As a reward for unlocking the DLC Shop, please accept this &n&lIron Pickaxe&r&2! May you harvest much with it!"
			]
			dependencies: ["1B6761988ABBBC4A"]
			hide: true
			id: "6D986E5817BEF5A1"
			tasks: [{
				id: "63AA2C135C5C6B55"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Welcome to the DLC Shop!"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "54E8FFD4389969BC"
				type: "item"
				item: {
					id: "minecraft:iron_pickaxe"
					Count: 1b
					tag: {
						Damage: 0
					}
				}
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -3.5d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Earned and Spent"
			description: [
				"&2The primary form of &n&lcurrency&r&2 for the Game Server is called &n&lVault Coins&r&2! "
				""
				"&2Every Vault Coin is actually a piece of &n&lcryptocurrency&r&2 that the server tracks for your safety! How secure!"
				""
				"&2Vault Coins are only useable in the FOP Game Server! They are used for many things : &n&lbuying Shop DLC&r&2, purchasing items in the &cERROR&r&2, paying for &n&lgear rerolls&r&2, and for &n&lbuying your body back&r&2 if you die! And much more!"
				""
				"&2There are six tiers of Vault Coins - &n&lCopper, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Palladium, and Iridum&r&2! Each tier trades up to the next tier at a &n&l9:1 ratio&r&2! So 9 Vault Copper turns into 1 Vault Silver!"
				""
				"&2Please take this &n&lStarter Wallet&r&2, a handy place to store ALL your money."
				""
				"&dYeah and when you die you lose it and have to buy it back to get the money. You know what, let me fix that... And bam... Soulbound!"
			]
			dependencies: ["6D986E5817BEF5A1"]
			hide: true
			id: "05F4CBBD146B0DBB"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1163E6E066AE8F3C"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Currencies of the Game"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "4A216024A73DC84C"
				type: "item"
				item: {
					id: "lightmanscurrency:wallet_copper"
					Count: 1b
					tag: {
						RepairCost: 1
						display: {
							Name: "{\"text\":\"Starter Wallet\"}"
						}
						Enchantments: [{
							lvl: 1s
							id: "ensorcellation:soulbound"
						}]
					}
				}
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -3.5d
			y: -0.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Fight For Fun!"
			description: [
				"&2Vault Coins are &n&leasy to earn&r&2! There are multiple approved methods of earning Vault Coins in the FOPGame Server."
				""
				"&2The &n&lprimary&r&2 way all users can earn Vault Coins is &n&linside the Vaults&r&2! You can find piles of Coins scattered around some points of interest! They'll be guarded though, so be ready to fight!"
				""
				"&2The &n&lsecond&r&2 approved method of earning Vault Coins is by completing &n&lBounties&r&2! Make yourself a Bounty Table, and you can select a Bounty that can earn you Vault Coins, amongst other rewards!"
				""
				"&2The &n&lfinal&r&2 approved method, and easiest, is to procure resources and materials, and &n&lDIGITALIZE&r&2 them!"
				""
				"&4&lALL OTHER METHODS ARE UNAUTHORIZED. AVOID FOR YOUR SAFETY!"
			]
			dependencies: ["05F4CBBD146B0DBB"]
			hide: true
			id: "22810A844797AC73"
			tasks: [{
				id: "277A1582F878E08F"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Earning Scrypto"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Digitalization"
			x: -3.5d
			y: 1.75d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Sell Almost Anything!"
			description: [
				"&2If the combat system of the Game Server is not to your liking, or you just want a break from it, then why not &n&lDigitalize&r&2 the stuff you've collected?"
				""
				"&2Take all that &n&lequipment, resources, machines&r&2, and more that you've made and let collect dust, and combine it with our &n&lpatented Digitalizer&r&2! "
				""
				"&4&n&lNOTE : Not all items are valid for Digitalization. Terms/conditions apply."
				""
				"&2By &n&lcombining&r&2 our &n&lDigitalizer&r&2 with, for example, a &n&lBlock of Iron&r&2, you will turn it into a &n&lbag of Digitalized Items&r&2! How many of these you get depends on how valuable the item you Digitalize is!"
				""
				"&2Then, to &n&lsell us the Digitalized Items&r&2, all you need to do is &n&lcombine NINE bags in any crafting table&r&2! Our system will detect this, and give you a &n&lVault Bronze&r&2 in return!"
				""
				"&2PLEASE INSERT 1,000 &dWrong. One sec... &4ERROR &21 &n&lVAULT BRONZE&r&2 PAYMENT."
			]
			dependencies: ["27CEECCDD982B0F4"]
			hide: true
			id: "1363CB79C9B54E49"
			tasks: [{
				id: "20022A2037551A06"
				type: "item"
				item: "the_vault:vault_bronze"
				consume_items: true
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "23040D7A565F933F"
				type: "item"
				item: "tfb2:fop_digitalizer"
			}]
		}
		{
			x: -3.5d
			y: 2.75d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Don't forget your DLC!"
			description: [
				"&2Now that you are up to speed and know how to earn money, new Power User, the rest of the DLC Store is open to you!"
				""
				"&2In a survey of the last 10,000 Power Users, 88% agreed that the &n&lfastest way to earn Vault Coins&r&2 was by diving into Vaults, collecting everything, and selling us the items! You can also..."
				""
				"&dPfff, okay &n&lenough&r&d of their spiel, Bandit. You can see the &n&lgrift&r&d now, right?"
				""
				"&dCombat pays &n&lpennies&r&d, but not as &n&lbad&r&d as their &n&lDigitalization&r&d system &n&lgouges you&r&d!"
				""
				"&dThough, it might not be much faster to &n&lhelp us break the system&r&d open either, not if you need something specific that's locked behind DLC."
				""
				"&d&n&lPick and choose your battles&r&d, of course. We understand fully the tough spot you are in."
			]
