			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Combat Improved"
			description: [
				"&2Unlike our previous server offerings for combat, the &n&lprimary combat&r&2 in the FOP Game Server is handled by &n&lBetter Combat&r&2. Smoother animations, combos, and more, which have a much different feel to vanilla Minecraft combat!"
				""
				"&2The combat animations and combos change depending on what weapons you are using. A sword, for exmaple, will feeld ifferent than a Battlestaff or an Axe!"
				""
				"&2If you are very used to Vanilla combat, our combat system may feel jarring and out of place. Our apologies, but we would highly recommend &n&lgiving it a chance&r&2 through a couple Vaults first!"
				""
				"&2If you still prefer Vanilla Minecraft combat, you can &n&lenable and disable Better Combat&r&2 by pressing the appropriate keybind. By default, this is &n&lPeriod&r&2."
			]
